    "If a monitor is set to 'mirror', only the mirrored monitor will be displayed here. The other mirrored monitor will not display." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若将一个显示器设置为“镜像”，则此处仅显示被镜像的显示器。另一个镜像的显示器不会显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If System Settings shows permission is ON but this page still says it is OFF, the change has not been applied to this running app process. Quit (⌘Q) and reopen, or remove and re-add the app in the permission list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果系统设置里权限已开启，但此页面仍显示未授权，说明权限变更尚未应用到当前运行的应用进程。请退出（⌘Q）并重新打开，或在权限列表中移除并重新添加本应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
